grounding.quote:
For an arriving report, start at [Universal intake triage](#universal-intake-triage).
[Change classes](#change-classes) locates the owning layer;
[Computed classification and treatment](#computed-classification-and-treatment)
separates what rules decide from judgment and owner decisions;
[Consistency gate](#consistency-gate) decides closure over the affected span.
The family table traces those rules and creates no second decision path.

A sprint may contain durable tickets, manifest-local iteration entries, or
both. Tickets carry work items that need durable identity across sessions;
manifest-local iteration entries carry small changes whose only independent
value is traceability inside the sprint. The sprint is the batch authority;
it does not erase the need for paydown tickets when close review finds debt
that must survive past the sprint (P2, P4b).
